# Bloodmoon "Bar Brawl", Falco's side: three days after Uryn (ColonyTimer),
# Falco sends the player to old Seler Favelnim, who picks fights in the bar.
# ColonySeler moves him there, greets within 300 units (40) and attacks; after
# 30 seconds he tires (50) and greets again. Talking him down through the
# "fight me" choices spares him (60), and Falco closes it (80, ColonyState 11).
# The fight is not a brawler's (no OnPCHitMe), so the brawl switch is moot.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_co_thief --timeout 2400
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case co_bar_brawl
run
player->PositionCell -450 -142 330 0 "Raven Rock, Vacant House"
activate 0676D5A3
sleep 24
activate 0676D5A3
sleep 24
activate 0676D5A3
sleep 24
activate 0676D5A3
sleep 24
until 600 ColonyState == 10
run
player->Position -197200 160250 870 0
until 600 "Falco Galenus"->GetDistance player < 400
talk Falco Galenus
ask assignment
ask Seler Favelnim
expect GetJournalIndex CO_7 == 10
bye
run
player->PositionCell 4480 3700 15820 0 "Raven Rock, Bar"
until 600 GetJournalIndex CO_7 == 40
bye
until 1800 GetJournalIndex CO_7 == 50
ask fight me
choose 2
choose 3
choose 4
choose 5
expect GetJournalIndex CO_7 == 60
bye
run
player->Position -197200 160250 870 0
until 600 "Falco Galenus"->GetDistance player < 400
talk Falco Galenus
ask Seler Favelnim
expect GetJournalIndex CO_7 == 80
expect ColonyState == 11
bye
end
